WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.807 --> 00:00:14.448
Mandy was very upset.

2
00:00:15.588 --> 00:00:21.130
Rishi was explaining the caste system, but she didn't think it was right.

3
00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:23.790
"It's cruel!"

4
00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:25.471
she said angrily.

5
00:00:25.491 --> 00:00:29.192
"You treat cows better than humans."

6
00:00:30.552 --> 00:00:35.315
"The untouchables did something wrong in a past life," explained Rishi.

7
00:00:35.335 --> 00:00:38.056
"The gods are punishing them."

8
00:00:38.076 --> 00:00:43.119
"But you don't even look at them," said Mandy.

9
00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:47.181
Vinnie poked Mandy to keep quiet.

10
00:00:47.201 --> 00:00:53.444
"If we look at them, we will be unclean for the whole day," said Rishi.

11
00:00:53.464 --> 00:00:57.327
"Well, I think—," Mandy began.

12
00:00:58.647 --> 00:01:01.981
Vinnie interrupted: "I think we're at the palace."

13
00:01:03.441 --> 00:01:06.583
They looked ahead and saw a spectacular view.

14
00:01:08.103 --> 00:01:11.264
Flowers decorated the road to the palace entrance.

15
00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:16.347
The children passed through an arch with fountains on either side.

16
00:01:16.367 --> 00:01:19.708
"It's wonderful!"

17
00:01:20.508 --> 00:01:23.129
Mandy gasped, forgetting her anger.

18
00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:28.031
"Look at the elephants and monkeys!"

19
00:01:28.832 --> 00:01:29.652
Vinnie laughed.

20
00:01:30.868 --> 00:01:33.851
Trainers were putting gold paint on two elephants.

21
00:01:35.212 --> 00:01:37.994
Monkeys sat in the trees above, watching.

22
00:01:39.095 --> 00:01:42.878
Golden statues stood along the way to the palace door.

23
00:01:43.939 --> 00:01:46.121
A male servant led them inside.

24
00:01:46.141 --> 00:01:51.345
"The palace has over a hundred rooms," whispered Rishi.

25
00:01:51.365 --> 00:01:54.067
"This one is for chess."

26
00:01:55.148 --> 00:01:56.910
He pointed to an open door.

27
00:01:56.930 --> 00:01:59.272
"There are many bedrooms.

28
00:02:00.492 --> 00:02:03.174
The king can sleep in a different bed every night."

29
00:02:04.455 --> 00:02:06.397
They waited behind two women.

30
00:02:07.618 --> 00:02:10.280
One woman held a live chicken in her arm.

31
00:02:11.381 --> 00:02:13.943
She was yelling at a woman holding a baby.

32
00:02:13.963 --> 00:02:15.704
"There you are!"

33
00:02:16.185 --> 00:02:18.186
a familiar voice said sharply.

34
00:02:19.307 --> 00:02:22.049
It was Babu Yadav waiting by a doorway.

35
00:02:23.230 --> 00:02:27.133
Music floated out of the room as the women ahead of them went in.

36
00:02:27.153 --> 00:02:30.056
"Babu Yadav, have pity.

37
00:02:31.404 --> 00:02:34.886
These children are strangers," began Rishi's father.

38
00:02:34.906 --> 00:02:40.550
"They did not know "I don't care," said Babu Yadav.

39
00:02:40.570 --> 00:02:42.612
"He must be punished."

40
00:02:44.393 --> 00:02:46.794
The women quickly came out through the door.

41
00:02:46.814 --> 00:02:49.236
"It's our turn.

42
00:02:49.596 --> 00:02:50.597
The king is waiting!"

43
00:02:51.077 --> 00:02:54.740
exclaimed Babu Yadav, as he walked into the king's hall.

44
00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:58.242
Rishi's father and the children followed.

45
00:02:58.262 --> 00:03:03.825
"Whoa!" gasped Vinnie when he stepped inside.

46
00:03:05.026 --> 00:03:08.607
A tiger tied to a post was licking a huge bone.

47
00:03:09.748 --> 00:03:13.029
A small distance away, musicians were playing.

48
00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:16.051
One plucked a harp.

49
00:03:17.751 --> 00:03:22.594
Two women stood beside a short, fat, man sitting on a soft couch.

50
00:03:23.774 --> 00:03:27.776
They gently waved fans made of animal hair over his head.

51
00:03:29.116 --> 00:03:31.939
The man wore a long robe and tight pants.

52
00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:36.363
The turban on his head was decorated with jewels.

53
00:03:36.383 --> 00:03:39.005
"What is your problem?"

54
00:03:39.725 --> 00:03:40.566
the man asked.

55
00:03:40.586 --> 00:03:47.852
"My king, I come before you with a troubled heart," Babu Yadav began, bowing low.

56
00:03:49.114 --> 00:03:52.156
The king nodded for Babu Yadav to continue.

57
00:03:53.798 --> 00:03:59.001
The man told about the cow and Vinnie, and the king's eyes opened wide.

58
00:04:00.062 --> 00:04:02.203
He stared at Vinnie and Mandy.

59
00:04:02.223 --> 00:04:06.105
"You are not from India," he pointed out.

60
00:04:06.125 --> 00:04:11.568
"No, sir, I mean, your majesty," Vinnie stuttered.

61
00:04:11.588 --> 00:04:16.811
"If I may go on, my king," Babu Yadav interrupted.

62
00:04:18.052 --> 00:04:19.573
The king held up his hand.

63
00:04:19.593 --> 00:04:22.374
"Your cow was not harmed.

64
00:04:23.575 --> 00:04:29.372
So we can overlook this matter," yawned the king.

65
00:04:30.816 --> 00:04:31.999
He clapped his hands.

66
00:04:32.019 --> 00:04:33.663
"Next!"
